Z||000000||WhiteFieroBlur||06-01-2000||09:54 PM||||I have read the later posts on this blue dingy box(brings back any memories?) <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> and I hadn't heard any chime at all since I bought my fiero GT. I thought they didn't have a chime. And I have left my lights on so many times I can't count and had to recharge my battery. How do I check the box and make it sound that anooying sound we all love again? I feel so left out  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">||||reg||1
