Z||000002||tgowens||06-01-2000||10:36 PM||||hmmmmmmm, maybe he disconnected the motors?? -- the blue dingy thingy is located under the passenger side of the dashboard on what Pontiac called "the convenience center" -- it is located right behind the dash pocket -- quite possibly someone removed the "blue dingy thingy" before you got your GT.......if it is missing I'm sure there are lots of people on here who would part with theirs in an instant!!||||reg||1
Z||000003||WhiteFieroBlur||06-02-2000||12:22 AM||||ok this is how I left my lights on. You know how sports cars like cameros and firebirds have thier orange lights at the bottom on? Well I always thought it would be kewl to leave my orange lights on while I drive. Mine are not as bright as thiers but I just like the way they look coming at you down the road. But I am starting to forget I have them on and take my lil trip to recharge my battery. And yes I am among many who have headlights that don't wanna pop up anymore <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> I am probably gonna get that 9 dollar kit to fix that problem.||||reg||1
