Z||000016||feffer||06-02-2000||10:16 PM||||MY blue thingy was dinging all the time, too!<BR>What a relief to find it's so common. I think whoever that was that said it had something to do with the parking brake might be on to something. My dashboard brake light is always on. It came on (and hasn't gone off since) one day about 3 months after I removed the cable. And the bell started dinging shortly after that. I tried jiggling the e-brake lever. I tried smacking the dashboard. I tried the foul language late at night. Finally, I risked rug burn on my head and crawled under there and pulled that blue sucker out.||||reg||1
